<p>When you hit with a melee or arrow attack, there is a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">26%, 35%, 40%, 44%, 46%</acronym> chance that a warden will appear from another timeline to attack a random enemy.</p><p>The summoned warden will attempt a melee attack if you made an arrow attack, or an arrow attack if you made a melee attack.</p><p>These wardens are out of phase with your reality and deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">43%, 34%, 29%, 25%, 23%</acronym> less damage, and their arrows will pass through friendly targets.</p><p>A warden can only be summoned this way once per turn and they return to their own timeline after attacking.</p>